# A fix to step 9: the settings a repository could slow or stall a session
# with (docs/steps/09/answered.md, "Settings a repository could slow a session
# with (2026-11-15)"). A break for each key's range, one for each change of
# class, and the mechanism: tighten-only on a length of time, its warning, and
# the check over the schema.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ ranges

[break] backoff-base-retries-at-once
rule: retry.backoff_base is at least 100 ms, in every file: below it the attempts are spent before a brief outage can pass.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 100ms..=1m]
replace: [TightenOnly, Now, 0s..=1m]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range
    cortex-config::it waits::a_project_cannot_shorten_a_wait_past_its_floor

[break] backoff-cap-has-no-floor
rule: retry.backoff_cap is at least a second, so that the attempts span more than a moment.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 1s..=5m]
replace: [TightenOnly, Now, 0s..=5m]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] max-wait-below-a-minute
rule: retry.max_wait is at least a minute, so that no file can make an ordinary rate limit end a turn.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 1m..=1h]
replace: [TightenOnly, Now, 0s..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] idle-timeout-of-a-millisecond
rule: retry.idle_timeout is at least 30 s: set to a millisecond it would fail every request.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 30s..=1h]
occurrence: 1
replace: [TightenOnly, Now, 1ms..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] first-event-timeout-of-a-millisecond
rule: retry.first_event_timeout is at least 30 s: set to a millisecond it would fail every request.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 30s..=1h]
occurrence: 2
replace: [TightenOnly, Now, 1ms..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range
    cortex-config::it waits::a_project_cannot_shorten_a_wait_past_its_floor

[break] a-providers-idle-timeout-unbounded
rule: A provider's own idle_timeout has the range of retry.idle_timeout.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [UserOnly, Now, 30s..=1h]
occurrence: 1
replace: [UserOnly, Now]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] a-providers-first-event-timeout-has-no-floor
rule: A provider's own first_event_timeout has the range of retry.first_event_timeout.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [UserOnly, Now, 30s..=1h]
occurrence: 2
replace: [UserOnly, Now, 0s..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] speed-wait-of-a-day
rule: model.speed_wait is at most two minutes.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 0s..=2m]
replace: [TightenOnly, Now, 0s..=1d]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] speed-cooldown-of-nothing
rule: model.speed_cooldown is at least a minute, so that a session does not change speed every few requests.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [Preference, Now, 1m..=1h]
replace: [Preference, Now, 0s..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] shortest-cooldown-of-a-day
rule: model.speed_cooldown_min is at most an hour.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [Preference, Now, 0s..=1h]
replace: [Preference, Now, 0s..=1d]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] shell-timeout-of-nothing
rule: shell.timeout is at least a second: below it every command that asks for no limit would fail.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, NextSession, 1s..=30m]
replace: [TightenOnly, NextSession, 0s..=30m]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

[break] shell-max-timeout-of-a-millisecond
rule: shell.max_timeout is at least ten seconds: below it no build or test run could finish.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, NextSession, 10s..=1d]
replace: [TightenOnly, NextSession, 1ms..=1d]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- classes

[break] backoff-base-a-preference
rule: A project's file may shorten retry.backoff_base and may not lengthen it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 100ms..=1m]
replace: [Preference, Now, 100ms..=1m]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it trust::every_key_has_a_trust_class
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not

[break] backoff-cap-a-preference
rule: A project's file may shorten retry.backoff_cap and may not lengthen it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 1s..=5m]
replace: [Preference, Now, 1s..=5m]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not

[break] max-wait-a-preference
rule: A project's file may shorten retry.max_wait and may not lengthen it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 1m..=1h]
replace: [Preference, Now, 1m..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not

[break] idle-timeout-a-preference
rule: A project's file may shorten retry.idle_timeout and may not lengthen it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 30s..=1h]
occurrence: 1
replace: [Preference, Now, 30s..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not
    cortex-config::it waits::a_length_of_time_is_tightened_against_the_one_in_effect_in_any_units

[break] first-event-timeout-a-preference
rule: A project's file may shorten retry.first_event_timeout and may not lengthen it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 30s..=1h]
occurrence: 2
replace: [Preference, Now, 30s..=1h]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not

[break] speed-wait-a-preference
rule: A project's file may shorten model.speed_wait and may not lengthen it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 0s..=2m]
replace: [Preference, Now, 0s..=2m]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not

[break] shell-timeout-a-preference
rule: A project's file may shorten shell.timeout and may not lengthen it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, NextSession, 1s..=30m]
replace: [Preference, NextSession, 1s..=30m]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not

[break] background-summary-a-preference
rule: Turning the background summary off is the user's alone: off, every compaction waits for its summary.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [UserOnly, Now] pub background: bool = true
replace: [Preference, Now] pub background: bool = true
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it trust::every_key_has_a_trust_class
    cortex-config::it waits::only_the_user_turns_the_background_summary_off

# --------------------------------------------------------------- mechanism

[break] tighten-only-reads-no-length-of-time
rule: A tighten-only length of time is compared as one, so that a project can shorten it.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/mod.rs
in: Trust::class
find: (types::magnitude(value), current.and_then(types::magnitude))
replace: (value.as_integer().map(|n| n as f64), current.and_then(|c| c.as_integer().map(|n| n as f64)))
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it waits::a_project_may_shorten_each_wait_and_time_limit
    cortex-config::it waits::a_length_of_time_is_tightened_against_the_one_in_effect_in_any_units

[break] tighten-only-compared-with-the-default
rule: A project's tighten-only value is compared with the value in effect, the user's included, not with the default.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/merge.rs
in: Merger::set
find: let class = trust.class(value, self.current(key));
replace: let class = trust.class(value, crate::merge::get(&self.defaults, key));
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it waits::a_length_of_time_is_tightened_against_the_one_in_effect_in_any_units

[break] tighten-only-warning-says-may-not-set
rule: The warning for a longer wait or limit says a project may lower it, and names the value in effect.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/merge.rs
in: Merger::admit
find: (Trust::TightenOnly, Some(current)) =>
replace: (Trust::TightenOnly, Some(current)) if false =>
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it waits::no_project_may_lengthen_a_wait_or_a_time_limit_trusted_or_not

[break] a-number-a-project-sets-without-a-range
rule: Every length of time or number a project's file can set has a range, or a reason on the check's list.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Restart, 1..=10_000_000]
replace: [TightenOnly, Restart]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it waits::every_number_a_project_can_set_has_a_range

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ readers

[break] a-supervisor-sets-a-wait
rule: A client that is not a `user` is refused a tighten-only override in session/new: it ranks as the command line, past the rule that holds a project to the value in effect.
file: crates/cortex-core/src/core.rs
in: only_preferences
find: Trust::Preference | Trust::RaisesCost | Trust::BySpeed
replace: Trust::Preference | Trust::RaisesCost | Trust::BySpeed | Trust::TightenOnly
caught-by:
    cortex-core::it settings::a_supervisor_cannot_start_a_session_above_the_level_it_could_set

# ------------------------------------------------------- after the review

[break] backoff-factor-a-preference
rule: A project's file may lower retry.backoff_factor and may not raise it: a larger one makes every later wait longer.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 1..=10]
replace: [Preference, Now, 1..=10]
caught-by:
    cortex-config::it trust::the_documented_classes_hold
    cortex-config::it waits::a_project_may_lower_the_backoff_factor_and_not_raise_it

[break] the-shell-default-past-the-longest
rule: A command's default time limit is held to shell.max_timeout, so that the tool never offers a default it may not have.
file: crates/cortex-core/src/assemble.rs
in: shell_limits
find: settings.shell.timeout.min(longest)
replace: settings.shell.timeout
caught-by:
    cortex-core assemble::shell_limit_tests::a_commands_default_limit_is_held_to_the_longest

[break] idle-timeout-of-a-day
rule: retry.idle_timeout is at most an hour.
file: crates/cortex-config/src/schema/sections.rs
find: [TightenOnly, Now, 30s..=1h]
occurrence: 1
replace: [TightenOnly, Now, 30s..=1d]
caught-by:
    cortex-config validate::tests::each_wait_and_time_limit_is_held_to_its_range
